{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Queue Queen is a game like <strong>Balatro</strong> and <strong>Nubby's Number Factory</strong> where you stack cards, trigger items and build game-breaking combos to clear the rounds in a limited time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More than\u00a0<strong>10 million items</strong>, because they are all randomly generated</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have white items which trigger when cards are evaluated after you've filled your stack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yellow items trigger at any time when something happens, even in the shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pink items are like very powerful yellow items, but they can't be force triggered by other item.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue items grant passive bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tailor your build using the Cardmage Parlor and the Backroom Printer</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Cardmage Parlor</strong> lets you buy/clone/destroy cards or give them buffs which trigger at different times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the\u00a0<strong>Backroom Printer</strong> you can merge, duplicate or edit your items to build even stronger items.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bosses that make the game more challenging</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can discard your stack, or swap your items around, or forcibly sell them, so plan for them accordingly!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the above is also included in the demo, however there are a few other exclusions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo excludes endless mode, which allows you to test your winning builds to see how far they can go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All New Game + modes are excluded.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only get to do 20 total runs in the demo.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4081060?t=1760523741","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4081060?t=1760523741","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081060/5ce46ee751022d65e54d69c07a66486b9bc4a8b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760523741","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081060/5ce46ee751022d65e54d69c07a66486b9bc4a8b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760523741","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Queue Queen is a game like <strong>Balatro</strong> and <strong>Nubby's Number Factory</strong> where you stack cards, trigger items and build game-breaking combos to clear the rounds in a limited time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More than\u00a0<strong>10 million items</strong>, because they are all randomly generated</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have white items which trigger when cards are evaluated after you've filled your stack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yellow items trigger at any time when something happens, even in the shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pink items are like very powerful yellow items, but they can't be force triggered by other item.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue items grant passive bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tailor your build using the Cardmage Parlor and the Backroom Printer</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Cardmage Parlor</strong> lets you buy/clone/destroy cards or give them buffs which trigger at different times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the\u00a0<strong>Backroom Printer</strong> you can merge, duplicate or edit your items to build even stronger items.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bosses that make the game more challenging</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can discard your stack, or swap your items around, or forcibly sell them, so plan for them accordingly!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the above is also included in the demo, however there are a few other exclusions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo excludes endless mode, which allows you to test your winning builds to see how far they can go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All New Game + modes are excluded.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only get to do 20 total runs in the demo.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Lisisoft"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3941130","name":"Queue Queen"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081060/cb6b99d4951f9d4f5a9553209f8fef9a75ed0098/header.jpg?t=1760523741","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Dual Core equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.1+ compatible card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 12<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M (Macbook 2013 and newer)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><stro